---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Privacy | Cottonwood Library demo">
  <section class="container py-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl">Privacy on this demo website</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-5">
      <p>This is a demonstration website. Its statistics are test traffic, not a report of visits to the library's existing website.</p>
      <p>If you choose "Allow statistics," Google Analytics uses cookies to measure the pages you visit and selected catalog and donation-button clicks. Clicking a donation button does not mean a donation was completed.</p>
      <p>Our tracking does not send names, email addresses, form contents, or website address query strings. Advertising features and Google's enhanced measurement are disabled. Google processes browser and usage information according to its <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      <p>Choosing "No thanks" prevents this website from loading Google Analytics. Use "Privacy choices" at the bottom of any page to change your decision. Withdrawing your choice stops tracking and removes this site's Analytics cookies.</p>
      <p>The embedded map uses OpenStreetMap data served by OpenFreeMap. Loading it sends normal web requests to the map provider; it does not request your device location.</p>
      <p>The library's website, fundraising service, catalog, and social accounts are separate services. Their privacy practices may differ. Contact details on this prototype remain subject to library review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
